    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 6,
        "sourceEnd": 231,
        "text": "Good evening, everyone. I'm Maya Chen, and I'm chairing tonight's meeting about the old train station site. We have three proposals for the empty land. First, can the planning team tell us what was found in the public survey?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "47f172b139a0816f56f50ab7ddd12e92f8d0830e407fa6c13d4f4cdd90ab119b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 241,
        "sourceEnd": 422,
        "text": "Yes. Last month, 1,200 residents were asked about the site. Most people said they wanted more green space. A smaller group asked for a sports center. Only a few people wanted shops.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "384c4bec6fd1b4acf67ffc7763623dfc4b5fdc0093190d03ea204c7a59885a53",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 430,
        "sourceEnd": 546,
        "text": "Thank you, Daniel. So the survey shows strong support for a park. Now, let's hear the proposals. Anna, you're first.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "b548aa02d0b7d0bb88b1e33119d9878e79a810e3d534352670e583afa1f97343",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 554,
        "sourceEnd": 818,
        "text": "My group proposes a community garden. The garden would be built by local volunteers. It would include raised beds, a small tool shed, and a seating area. The cost is low because the work would be done by residents. Also, fresh vegetables would be grown and shared.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "c74aafc824381af6498ddbf38c11a3f49ea91410c1b7c378056cb3a13a6ab292",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 826,
        "sourceEnd": 863,
        "text": "Thanks, Anna. Any questions for Anna?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7d419aeb20fe76b171331fc315357f7d2998ab44836a6a94a5e8ff11b1936a5c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "daniel",
        "speaker": "Daniel",
        "sourceStart": 873,
        "sourceEnd": 929,
        "text": "I have one. Who would take care of the garden in winter?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a2d716263140afcb89aefe82ea511e150dd2e81bef41c5ba36d55704ad845b76",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "anna",
        "speaker": "Anna",
        "sourceStart": 937,
        "sourceEnd": 1026,
        "text": "Good question. A volunteer group would manage it. The city would provide water and tools.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2530fb91df42e165ab273c804d81de1c49d17b0aa23ae807bf4cd06d1fa7b879",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1034,
        "sourceEnd": 1050,
        "text": "OK. Next is Ben.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c9a5e200b81bb23ee22ca60b86b40c91e2b1951a7318686495242149d66b9bd0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1057,
        "sourceEnd": 1312,
        "text": "Our proposal is a sports center. It would be designed for young people. We would have a basketball court, a climbing wall, and a small café. The building would be paid for by a private company. But the company would also run the café and keep the profits.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "1c7fdbf2222cd09e09f8860ed156f7a203b4e85db3ce2419954dba096bb20d67",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1320,
        "sourceEnd": 1359,
        "text": "Thank you, Ben. And the third proposal?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "78f62408acdd450c87aac79cfe5e1b9d81298cb29eb1559d2f736fc9f6bfc3c0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "priya",
        "speaker": "Priya",
        "sourceStart": 1368,
        "sourceEnd": 1643,
        "text": "I'm Priya. My team suggests a quiet reading park. It would have trees, benches, and a small open-air library. Books would be donated by residents. The park would be maintained by the city parks department. The cost is medium, but the space would be open to everyone, all day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "b1d25282ad05f5c9ed97027d90f3deede70e816167916b792e372b25b22a09f4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "maya",
        "speaker": "Maya",
        "sourceStart": 1651,
        "sourceEnd": 1857,
        "text": "Thank you, Priya. Now, before we vote, I want to remind everyone that the final decision will be made by the city council next month. Public comments can be sent by email until Friday. Thank you for coming.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "11c71b52f3bf06fe4edc8316191eb494df7ed35de57b53ef64d57e636eb4a917",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
